stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> TaskInProgress
    TaskInProgress --> DeliverableSubmitted: submit versioned evidence
    DeliverableSubmitted --> ReviewPending: create required review requests

    ReviewPending --> DeliverableAccepted: every review accepts and no carried finding remains open
    DeliverableAccepted --> TaskAccepted: all current task deliverables accepted
    TaskAccepted --> [*]

    ReviewPending --> DeliverableRejected: any reviewer rejects candidate evidence
    DeliverableRejected --> TaskInProgress: return task for rework
    TaskInProgress --> SuccessorDeliverable: address findings
    SuccessorDeliverable --> ReviewPending: supersede rejected deliverable and carry open findings

    ReviewPending --> DeliverableBlocked: reviewer records a concrete process or evidence blocker
    DeliverableBlocked --> TaskBlocked: block propagates
    TaskBlocked --> [*]

    note right of SuccessorDeliverable
      The rejected review remains immutable.
      A new deliverable and new reviews carry lineage.
    end note

    note right of TaskBlocked
      Blocked is not rejection and does not
      automatically enter the rework cascade.
      Explicit intervention must create the next valid step.
    end note
